ng the graduation ceremony.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tnZRHtvILI89gDAITmQ6px0QEpy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7128","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"7062","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"7062","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"67590","synopsis":"The girls pick the tomatoes they planted in the garden of Hidamari Apartments earlier in the year. After they spend the day preparing tomato-based dishes, the landlady joins them for dinner, and later they give Yoshinoya the leftover pasta sauce.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iXoHKfCAD2hUTsLVJctq3g8Y3oO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"The girls pick the tomatoes they planted in the garden of Hidamari Apartments earlier in the year. After they spend the day preparing tomato-based dishes, the landlady joins them for dinner, and later they give Yoshinoya the leftover pasta sauce.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iXoHKfCAD2hUTsLVJctq3g8Y3oO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:7062","mal:7062"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7128","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"7062","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"7062","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45893","scope":"s3","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"82154","scope":"s3","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"ht